"                still in draft, or whose totals diverge from the\n"
"                mirror. Open each move and either post the mirror,\n"
"                or fix the mismatch on the side that drifted."
msgstr ""
"This list surfaces moves whose mirror is missing,\\n                still in"
" draft, or whose totals diverge from the\\n                mirror. Open each"
" move and either post the mirror,\\n                or fix the mismatch on "
"the side that drifted."

#. module: eh_account_intercompany
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_intercompany.field_eh_intercompany_config__activity_exception_decoration
msgid "Type of the exception activity on record."
msgstr "记录中异常活动的类型。"

#. module: eh_account_intercompany
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_intercompany.field_eh_intercompany_config__fallback_expense_account_id
msgid ""
"Used on mirror BILL lines (in_invoice/in_refund) when the source line's "
"product has no expense account configured in this company. Hard fail at post"
" time if neither this fallback nor the product account is set."
msgstr ""
"当源行的产品在本公司未配置费用科目时，用于镜像 BILL 行 "
"(in_invoice/in_refund)。如果此后备科目和产品科目均未设置，则在过账时硬失败。"

#. module: eh_account_intercompany
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_intercompany.field_eh_intercompany_config__fallback_revenue_account_id
msgid ""
"Used on mirror INVOICE lines (out_invoice/out_refund) when the source line's"
" product has no income account configured in this company. Hard fail at post"
" time if neither this fallback nor the product account is set."
msgstr ""
"当源行的产品在本公司未配置收入科目时，用于镜像 INVOICE 行 "
"(out_invoice/out_refund)。如果此后备科目和产品科目均未设置，则在过账时硬失败。"

#. module: eh_account_intercompany
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:eh_account_intercompany.field_eh_intercompany_config__website_message_ids
msgid "Website Messages"
msgstr "网站消息"

#. module: eh_account_intercompany
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_intercompany.field_eh_intercompany_config__website_message_ids
msgid "Website communication history"
msgstr "网站沟通记录"

#. module: eh_account_intercompany
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_intercompany.field_eh_intercompany_config__intercompany_user_id
msgid ""
"When set, mirror documents in this company are created and posted as this "
"user (instead of the elevated system context), so ownership and the audit "
"trail name a real responsible user. The user needs access to this company "
"and to accounting. Leave empty to create with elevated rights."
msgstr "设置后，无论匹配结果如何，该账单都将被搁置，永远不会报告为可付款。"

#. module: eh_account_intercompany
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_intercompany.field_eh_intercompany_config__auto_post_mirror
msgid ""
"When set, mirrors created on this company are posted automatically. Default "
"off so the receiving accountant reviews each mirror in draft state."
msgstr ""
"设置后，此通道上的作业将严格按到达顺序逐个执行，因此同一实体的工作（例如某一员工的 webhook 投递）绝不会被乱序或并发处理。普通通道仍保持并行。"

#. module: eh_account_intercompany
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_intercompany.field_res_partner__eh_represented_company_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_intercompany.field_res_users__eh_represented_company_id
msgid ""
"When set, posting an out_invoice for this partner triggers an inter-company "
"mirror as a vendor bill in the named company. Leave blank if the partner is "
"a regular customer."
msgstr "设置后，在此公司创建的镜像将自动过账。默认关闭，以便接收方会计以草稿状态审核每个镜像。"

#. module: eh_account_intercompany
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_intercompany.field_account_bank_statement_line__eh_intercompany_mirror_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_intercompany.field_account_move__eh_intercompany_mirror_id
msgid ""
"When this move is an inter-company source, this field points at the auto-"
"generated mirror in the counterparty company."
msgstr "当此分录为公司间源分录时，此字段指向对方公司中自动生成的镜像分录。"

#. module: eh_account_intercompany
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_intercompany.field_account_bank_statement_line__eh_intercompany_origin_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_intercompany.field_account_move__eh_intercompany_origin_id
msgid ""
"When this move is the auto-generated mirror of an inter-company source "
"invoice, this field points at that source. Used to prevent duplicate mirrors"
" when the source is re-posted."
msgstr "当此分录为公司间源发票的自动生成镜像时，此字段指向该源。用于在重新过账源时防止重复镜像。"
